hadiths[1]{hadithnumber,text}:
"16749","Abd Allah narrated to us, Abu Salih al-Hakam ibn Musa narrated to us, he said: Damra ibn Rabia narrated to us, from Uthman ibn Ata, from Abu Imran, from Dhu al-Asabi, he said: I said: O Messenger of Allah, if we are tried after you with survival, where do you command us; he said: Upon you is Bayt al-Maqdis, for perhaps offspring will arise for you going morning and evening to that mosque."
